WEBVTT

00:00:14.484 --> 00:00:16.584
Let's go. They all should be there by now.

00:00:22.124 --> 00:00:25.994
Welcome, fellow members of PANDRA.

00:00:28.564 --> 00:00:29.864
Major!

00:00:30.604 --> 00:00:34.664
The time for us to take action is drawing near.

00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:39.774
Yes... The age of the domination
of espers by Normals is over.

00:00:40.414 --> 00:00:43.854
And so, I think it's time that I introduced you.

00:00:44.684 --> 00:00:47.174
To she who will one day be the queen!

00:00:47.654 --> 00:00:48.854
Queen?

00:00:48.854 --> 00:00:53.754
The esper messiah who shall one
day free you all in my place!

00:00:56.034 --> 00:00:59.264
Stronger and lovelier than anyone else.

00:00:59.704 --> 00:01:03.034
The girl fated to eventually be our queen.

00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:06.594
And her name is...

00:01:07.644 --> 00:01:09.834
Kaoru Akashi!

00:01:10.274 --> 00:01:13.174
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:01:13.584 --> 00:01:16.444
Boy, does it feel great

00:01:16.814 --> 00:01:19.584
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:20.024 --> 00:01:23.184
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:01:25.094 --> 00:01:26.224
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:26.224 --> 00:01:27.394
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:27.394 --> 00:01:28.664
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:01:28.664 --> 00:01:30.334
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:31.354
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:34.804
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:01:34.804 --> 00:01:37.274
The limiter on my heart

00:01:38.004 --> 00:01:40.704
Has been released, and then you see

00:01:41.104 --> 00:01:44.304
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:44.544 --> 00:01:47.414
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:01:47.714 --> 00:01:51.014
Reaching through what's real

00:01:51.014 --> 00:01:54.254
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:54.254 --> 00:01:57.194
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:01:58.324 --> 00:02:04.794
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:02:04.794 --> 00:02:10.734
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:02:11.174 --> 00:02:15.574
If you can take pride in a smile

00:02:15.574 --> 00:02:17.564
That suits no one else

00:02:17.774 --> 00:02:22.314
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:02:22.314 --> 00:02:26.414
We can try over the future world!

00:02:26.654 --> 00:02:27.014
Yeah!

00:02:27.754 --> 00:02:28.414
Ultimate!

00:02:30.554 --> 00:02:31.784
Daring!

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:41.064
23rd sense.
"Plot Twist! Stolen Away!"

00:02:41.064 --> 00:02:42.834
23rd sense.
"Plot Twist! Stolen Away!"
Come on, just spill it!

00:02:43.404 --> 00:02:45.304
Why'd you do it?!

00:02:45.304 --> 00:02:46.974
I'm Moga-chan!

00:02:46.974 --> 00:02:49.414
Why did you betray BABEL?!

00:02:49.414 --> 00:02:53.844
Tomorrow is my birthday!
Won't you come and play with me?

00:02:54.584 --> 00:02:56.454
What's your objective?

00:02:56.454 --> 00:02:59.244
I'm Moga-chan! Tomorrow is my birthday!

00:02:59.324 --> 00:03:01.114
Answer me!

00:03:01.384 --> 00:03:03.654
Looks like he's still keeping quiet.

00:03:06.264 --> 00:03:08.594
No good. I can't get a reading.

00:03:08.594 --> 00:03:11.424
I can't spot any abnormalities,
even with my clairvoyance.

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:17.224
Takeshi Kugutsu... Who's pulling his strings?

00:03:25.014 --> 00:03:27.714
Oh, the hot guy I'll never forget!

00:03:27.714 --> 00:03:28.214
Hey!

00:03:28.214 --> 00:03:29.734
Guh! Muscle Ohkama!

00:03:29.854 --> 00:03:31.314
I've missed you!

00:03:31.454 --> 00:03:32.784
Cut it out!

00:03:33.224 --> 00:03:37.384
This is a fresh-picked daikon!
I love these things!

00:03:37.724 --> 00:03:40.424
So crisp and tasty!
You haven't straightened out at all.

00:03:43.594 --> 00:03:44.684
I'm home.

00:03:45.364 --> 00:03:47.134
Welcome home!

00:03:47.134 --> 00:03:48.534
Minamoto, you're late!

00:03:48.534 --> 00:03:50.124
Lately, you've been working overtime every day.

00:03:50.234 --> 00:03:52.904
Yeah, sorry about that. There's a lot going on.

00:03:52.904 --> 00:03:56.214
Hey! What's with those getups?!

00:03:56.214 --> 00:03:59.774
What do you mean? You like this
look, don't you, Minamoto?

00:04:00.314 --> 00:04:03.284
Don't stare like that. It's kind of embarrassing.

00:04:03.854 --> 00:04:05.644
Would you like a bath? Dinner, maybe?

00:04:07.054 --> 00:04:09.554
Come on! Quit hiding how you feel!

00:04:09.554 --> 00:04:11.324
What are you doing?!

00:04:11.324 --> 00:04:14.294
Is this the influence of some
worthless anime show?!

00:04:14.294 --> 00:04:16.594
That's it, isn't it?! Isn't it?!

00:04:16.594 --> 00:04:20.064
Huh? Doc, this isn't what you said he'd do!

00:04:20.064 --> 00:04:21.034
Doc?

00:04:21.034 --> 00:04:24.634
It's fine. Minamoto loves this kind of stuff!

00:04:25.304 --> 00:04:26.604
He's just shy.

00:04:26.604 --> 00:04:27.634
Sakaki!

00:04:29.874 --> 00:04:30.874
Absolutely! Chiru-Chiru!

00:04:30.874 --> 00:04:31.514
Absolutely!
CHIRU-CHIRU
Absolutely! Chiru-Chiru!

00:04:36.514 --> 00:04:38.654
Original Story KOSHI C-NA

00:04:38.654 --> 00:04:40.584
Character Design
KOUHAKU NISHI-O

00:04:43.654 --> 00:04:43.754
Absolutely not!

00:04:43.754 --> 00:04:45.354
Director - K-ICHIROU KAWAGUCHI
Absolutely not!

00:04:45.354 --> 00:04:47.284
Absolutely not!

00:04:50.564 --> 00:04:54.134
God, do you normally go around
hitting injured people?

00:04:54.134 --> 00:04:56.504
My wounds haven't even healed yet!

00:04:56.504 --> 00:04:58.764
If you're injured, you should be in bed.

00:04:58.904 --> 00:05:01.674
Shouldn't you be in the hospital?

00:05:01.674 --> 00:05:06.744
Well, three of my girlfriends ran
into each other there, so...

00:05:06.744 --> 00:05:08.414
What are you planning?!

00:05:08.414 --> 00:05:10.544
Break up with him now, you little thief!

00:05:11.014 --> 00:05:13.184
Say what?!

00:05:13.184 --> 00:05:14.914
Well, you can guess what happened.

00:05:15.184 --> 00:05:16.654
Hang in there, Chiru-Chiru!

00:05:16.654 --> 00:05:19.094
Give her your magical crybaby routine!

00:05:19.194 --> 00:05:20.694
That'll grab her heart!

00:05:20.694 --> 00:05:23.694
So, things being what they are,
let me hide out here for a bit.

00:05:23.694 --> 00:05:24.364
Forget it.

00:05:24.364 --> 00:05:28.734
Oh, come on! After I brought
a pizza and everything?

00:05:28.734 --> 00:05:33.734
You know why! I've already got three
wild animals to take care of here!

00:05:35.374 --> 00:05:37.314
Who are you calling wild animals?!

00:05:38.344 --> 00:05:40.504
Who do you think?

00:05:41.114 --> 00:05:43.214
We just wanted to make you feel better

00:05:43.214 --> 00:05:45.784
after all this overtime you've been pulling lately!

00:05:45.784 --> 00:05:50.454
We all finally managed to get time
to go home this weekend!

00:05:50.454 --> 00:05:54.254
Right, so we wanted to see you
happy again up until we leave!

00:05:54.694 --> 00:05:56.684
That's why we wore the aprons!

00:05:58.694 --> 00:06:01.534
See this salad? The three of us made it.

00:06:03.074 --> 00:06:05.304
We wanted to make more for you, but...

00:06:05.734 --> 00:06:08.804
But I cut up all the vegetables myself.

00:06:08.804 --> 00:06:11.044
I made the dressing.

00:06:11.044 --> 00:06:13.804
And I did the taste test and
putting it on the plate!

00:06:14.144 --> 00:06:17.874
And all you do is ignore our loving
meal and then call us wild animals!

00:06:18.584 --> 00:06:21.214
Hmpf! You don't deserve service like this!

00:06:22.084 --> 00:06:23.524
Kaoru?

00:06:34.164 --> 00:06:35.824
Mm. It's good.

00:06:36.734 --> 00:06:37.964
Thanks, Mr. Minamoto!

00:06:38.174 --> 00:06:40.204
We've got lots more, if you want seconds!

00:06:40.204 --> 00:06:41.604
We made dessert, too!

00:06:42.274 --> 00:06:43.174
Okay, okay.

00:06:45.774 --> 00:06:49.404
Right now, the queen is being
kept on a leash by the Normals.

00:06:49.814 --> 00:06:52.284
In order to rescue and welcome
her into our ranks,

00:06:52.924 --> 00:06:55.914
we have been making careful preparations!

00:07:06.564 --> 00:07:10.434
Kaoru Akashi! That girl's
supposed to be our queen?

00:07:11.034 --> 00:07:13.194
I'll never accept it!

00:07:20.144 --> 00:07:23.604
Because the major belongs to me!

00:07:36.534 --> 00:07:37.464
I'm sorry.

00:07:37.464 --> 00:07:39.634
It's okay. Just take it easy.

00:07:39.634 --> 00:07:40.934
Not that.

00:07:41.604 --> 00:07:44.124
I'm talking about Kugutsu.

00:07:45.134 --> 00:07:47.604
You're having a rough time with
the interrogation, right?

00:07:48.344 --> 00:07:49.464
I suppose.

00:07:49.574 --> 00:07:53.034
God, and I can tell how worried the girls are, too.

00:07:53.984 --> 00:07:55.744
You're going to work yourself to collapse!

00:07:56.584 --> 00:07:58.444
I'm not that weak.

00:07:58.514 --> 00:08:00.284
Besides, more than anything,

00:08:00.284 --> 00:08:03.024
I want to expose whoever was backing Kugutsu.

00:08:03.024 --> 00:08:04.144
Backing him?

00:08:04.254 --> 00:08:09.894
Yeah. I just don't think what he did
was only for a personal grudge.

00:08:10.364 --> 00:08:12.664
There has to be someone big backing them.

00:08:14.334 --> 00:08:17.364
Gotcha. Why don't I join you tomorrow?

00:08:17.804 --> 00:08:20.374
What are you talking about? You're still weak...

00:08:20.374 --> 00:08:22.774
I can't wait until I'm fully recovered.

00:08:23.214 --> 00:08:25.804
This is bugging me, too.

00:08:26.884 --> 00:08:31.904
If there's a group besides the Normal
People going after BABEL...

00:08:32.984 --> 00:08:35.124
I just have a bad feeling about this.

00:08:35.124 --> 00:08:36.184
Bad feeling?

00:08:36.254 --> 00:08:38.424
I know perfectly well that there are Normals

00:08:38.424 --> 00:08:40.764
who don't want peaceful
coexistence with espers.

00:08:40.764 --> 00:08:44.594
Some of us are fed up with their existence.

00:08:49.264 --> 00:08:51.404
I don't think it's strange at all

00:08:51.404 --> 00:08:54.634
for some espers to want to
fight Normals like that.

00:08:55.504 --> 00:09:00.004
Espers... Espers fighting Normals?

00:09:00.114 --> 00:09:01.584
Don't worry!

00:09:01.684 --> 00:09:04.244
We'll expose them and take them down.

00:09:06.054 --> 00:09:13.254
For the people we care for,
and... For your sake, too.

00:09:13.564 --> 00:09:16.124
So please, let me use my clairvoyance!

00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:18.094
Sakaki.

00:09:25.074 --> 00:09:26.634
M-Minamoto...

00:09:29.174 --> 00:09:33.234
What the heck?! Why the sudden,
suspicious change in atmosphere?!

00:09:33.684 --> 00:09:34.884
Sakaki...

00:09:34.884 --> 00:09:36.144
What?

00:09:38.484 --> 00:09:41.284
This is my bishop.

00:09:41.384 --> 00:09:42.454
Cheater.

00:09:42.454 --> 00:09:45.054
Whoops! Cat's out of the bag!

00:09:48.024 --> 00:09:50.424
Girls! You're still up?

00:09:51.734 --> 00:09:53.364
You know what time it is?

00:09:53.364 --> 00:09:55.734
Minamoto, we'll help, too!

00:09:56.974 --> 00:09:59.564
I think having me along will be useful.

00:09:59.744 --> 00:10:03.374
And if he still won't talk, I'll make him sorry!

00:10:03.374 --> 00:10:05.514
Didn't you say it before?

00:10:05.514 --> 00:10:07.674
That you wanted us to help you fight?

00:10:07.744 --> 00:10:09.614
Well, at the time...

00:10:09.684 --> 00:10:12.884
A team stands together!
Let's settle this as fast as we can!

00:10:27.334 --> 00:10:28.994
He's still sleeping.

00:10:29.064 --> 00:10:33.004
He may be exhausted from days
of continuous interrogation.

00:10:37.074 --> 00:10:39.374
Hey, get up, Kugutsu!

00:10:40.284 --> 00:10:43.214
I can tell when someone's pretending to sleep!

00:10:43.454 --> 00:10:45.214
C'mon, get up!

00:10:47.384 --> 00:10:49.484
This is a doll!

00:10:49.484 --> 00:10:52.524
Impossible! The ECM is operating properly.

00:10:52.524 --> 00:10:54.494
He couldn't have overidden it!

00:10:54.594 --> 00:10:57.834
Trouble! Inmate #140 is missing!

00:10:57.834 --> 00:10:58.794
What?!

00:11:00.304 --> 00:11:01.594
Muscle?!

00:11:01.704 --> 00:11:04.194
Could the two of them have escaped?

00:11:08.444 --> 00:11:11.534
These were still in the ground only an hour ago.

00:11:12.074 --> 00:11:15.984
Meaning, they couldn't have gotten very far.

00:11:16.144 --> 00:11:19.014
Okay, then let's go after them!

00:11:19.084 --> 00:11:21.454
Minamoto, release our limiters, please!

00:11:21.454 --> 00:11:24.594
Right! The Children, released!

00:11:24.594 --> 00:11:25.394
<<RELEASED>>
Right! The Children, released!

00:11:26.624 --> 00:11:29.464
It's no use trying to run from us!

00:11:30.294 --> 00:11:33.594
The more you run, the closer we get to you!

00:11:35.434 --> 00:11:38.134
That's because the Earth is round!

00:11:38.834 --> 00:11:41.274
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:11:44.614 --> 00:11:47.074
Darn it, where'd they escape to?

00:11:48.084 --> 00:11:50.104
Something's wrong with this field.

00:11:51.384 --> 00:11:52.644
What?!

00:11:56.024 --> 00:11:57.854
What are these things?

00:11:58.894 --> 00:12:02.324
What's with these creepily familiar dolls?!

00:12:03.564 --> 00:12:06.294
Trouble! The ECM is being jammed.

00:12:06.364 --> 00:12:07.234
What?!

00:12:07.304 --> 00:12:10.424
Kugutsu and Muscle couldn't have
pulled this off on their own!

00:12:10.974 --> 00:12:12.064
Could it be?

00:12:12.174 --> 00:12:15.434
Interchangeable cyborgs! You are in command!

00:12:15.504 --> 00:12:17.344
CHANGE!

00:12:23.854 --> 00:12:25.754
Bleaugh!

00:12:29.254 --> 00:12:30.744
Dachshund!

00:12:39.904 --> 00:12:41.364
Leave this to me!

00:12:46.474 --> 00:12:48.204
That's it, Aoi! Keep it up!

00:12:54.484 --> 00:12:56.034
Piece of cake!

00:12:56.344 --> 00:12:58.614
Hey! What's that?

00:13:03.624 --> 00:13:05.214
Has the boss arrived?

00:13:05.454 --> 00:13:07.164
You are in command!

00:13:07.164 --> 00:13:08.214
CHANGE!

00:13:26.684 --> 00:13:28.514
If they're being remotely-controlled by an esper,

00:13:28.514 --> 00:13:30.174
then their power is incredible!

00:13:38.724 --> 00:13:40.594
Interchangeable cyborgs!

00:13:40.764 --> 00:13:42.424
You are in command!

00:13:43.464 --> 00:13:45.064
So what if you're a cyborg?!

00:13:45.064 --> 00:13:46.054
Kaoru!

00:13:47.534 --> 00:13:51.364
PSYCHIC AEGIS SHIELD HYPER!

00:13:55.774 --> 00:13:57.004
Wow...

00:13:58.914 --> 00:14:00.574
Let's do this!

00:14:07.254 --> 00:14:10.244
You are... in command...

00:14:13.094 --> 00:14:14.584
We did it!

00:14:16.694 --> 00:14:18.064
Change...

00:14:20.564 --> 00:14:23.104
Well done, girls!

00:14:23.104 --> 00:14:25.904
If that missile had hit the isolation cell area,

00:14:25.904 --> 00:14:29.274
there would have been a mass breakout!

00:14:29.374 --> 00:14:31.814
But where are Kugutsu and Muscle?

00:14:32.944 --> 00:14:35.034
One thing has been made clear.

00:14:35.114 --> 00:14:37.744
Someone is definitely pulling their strings.

00:14:38.284 --> 00:14:40.084
Someone able to pull something like this off...

00:14:40.084 --> 00:14:43.854
It could only be one man: Kyosuke Hyobu.

00:14:43.954 --> 00:14:44.924
Yes, sir.

00:14:44.924 --> 00:14:47.864
What is that man up to?

00:14:50.464 --> 00:14:51.864
Major Hyobu!

00:14:52.364 --> 00:14:55.964
Thank you for saving me and Moga-chan!

00:14:56.234 --> 00:14:58.234
Major, I missed you!

00:14:58.234 --> 00:15:01.874
Many a sleepless night I spent
thinking of you, Major!

00:15:01.874 --> 00:15:04.004
Back off! You're crowding me!

00:15:04.574 --> 00:15:06.404
You two caused me some trouble.

00:15:07.444 --> 00:15:12.314
I'd hoped you'd stay with BABEL longer
to feed me good information.

00:15:12.384 --> 00:15:13.644
I'm sorry.

00:15:14.454 --> 00:15:15.584
It's all right.

00:15:15.584 --> 00:15:19.094
I've been thinking of
increasing our membership

00:15:19.094 --> 00:15:21.424
in order to welcome the queen.

00:15:21.424 --> 00:15:23.464
A member of the organization?

00:15:23.464 --> 00:15:24.894
Leave it to me, Major!

00:15:24.894 --> 00:15:27.464
I've been waiting for you to say those words!

00:15:27.464 --> 00:15:30.134
I'd do anything for you, Major!

00:15:30.134 --> 00:15:31.504
Me, too!

00:15:33.704 --> 00:15:35.294
Bad members...

00:15:43.214 --> 00:15:44.744
Pardon the intrusion.

00:15:44.814 --> 00:15:47.284
There's something you need to hear, Major.

00:15:48.054 --> 00:15:51.424
Looks like your speech
acknowledging the queen

00:15:51.424 --> 00:15:53.564
may have pushed some a little too far.

00:15:53.564 --> 00:15:55.064
Meaning what?

00:15:55.064 --> 00:16:00.224
It's only natural, as it affects all of us espers.

00:16:00.864 --> 00:16:03.804
There's one person especially
who won't accept it.

00:16:04.934 --> 00:16:06.764
What? Mio?

00:16:07.304 --> 00:16:09.364
I see. Thanks for the report.

00:16:11.574 --> 00:16:14.284
Honestly, that wild girl...

00:16:14.284 --> 00:16:18.084
Momotaro, could you accompany
her for a little while?

00:16:18.684 --> 00:16:21.984
What a pain in the ass.
You use people too roughly.

00:16:21.984 --> 00:16:26.184
I'll give you three years worth of
gourmet Andalusian sunflower seeds.

00:16:26.764 --> 00:16:29.524
Leave it to me, ol' bestest buddy of mine!

00:16:30.434 --> 00:16:33.724
Now then... What will Mio do?

00:16:35.664 --> 00:16:38.474
Are you sure about this, Minamoto?

00:16:38.474 --> 00:16:39.534
Of course I am.

00:16:39.534 --> 00:16:40.944
Yeah, but...

00:16:40.944 --> 00:16:44.774
It's okay. Precog has nothing unusual to report.

00:16:44.774 --> 00:16:45.874
But...

00:16:45.874 --> 00:16:47.544
Aoi has her little brother's birthday party,

00:16:47.684 --> 00:16:49.644
Shiho has dinner with her dad,

00:16:49.644 --> 00:16:52.584
and Kaoru's sister is bringing some
of her gravure idol friends home.

00:16:53.214 --> 00:16:56.844
You all have fun plans made.

00:16:57.554 --> 00:17:02.524
Okay, but don't get carried away
just because we're not around.

00:17:02.524 --> 00:17:04.794
And don't cry because you're lonely!

00:17:04.794 --> 00:17:06.494
We'll be back tomorrow night!

00:17:07.464 --> 00:17:09.264
Don't worry! Don't worry!

00:17:09.264 --> 00:17:13.634
I'll keep an eye on him so he
doesn't cheat on you, so relax!

00:17:14.044 --> 00:17:17.314
Actually, we're more worried
because you are here with him...

00:17:17.314 --> 00:17:18.144
Meaning what?

00:17:19.714 --> 00:17:21.204
Bye!

00:17:21.684 --> 00:17:22.844
See you later.

00:17:23.144 --> 00:17:24.914
Have fun!

00:17:25.914 --> 00:17:27.184
Okay!

00:17:27.824 --> 00:17:29.124
Man, oh, man...

00:17:29.124 --> 00:17:31.494
Now you can relax, huh?

00:17:31.494 --> 00:17:33.694
Yeah, now I can finally take my time...

00:17:33.694 --> 00:17:36.624
To go for a drink?! I'll invite Natsuko and Hotaru!

00:17:36.964 --> 00:17:38.694
First thing in the morning?

00:17:38.694 --> 00:17:41.604
Doctors shouldn't recommend
stuff that's bad for your health.

00:17:41.604 --> 00:17:43.124
A situation like this...

00:17:45.974 --> 00:17:48.404
Clearly calls for cleaning and laundry!

00:17:49.004 --> 00:17:52.314
Huh? Really? Seriously?

00:17:52.314 --> 00:17:54.784
This is what a healthy guy thinks up?

00:17:59.254 --> 00:18:02.284
This button on Kaoru's shirt is coming off.

00:18:02.284 --> 00:18:04.114
I'll mend it later.

00:18:04.224 --> 00:18:05.394
Man...

00:18:05.394 --> 00:18:07.864
You're such a mother hen.

00:18:07.994 --> 00:18:09.514
I suppose.

00:18:14.134 --> 00:18:15.104
What's wrong?

00:18:15.104 --> 00:18:18.734
Oh, just thinking how used to this I've gotten

00:18:18.734 --> 00:18:21.404
since I started living with them.

00:18:22.144 --> 00:18:26.104
Even if it's just for one night,
it's lonely here without them.

00:18:31.284 --> 00:18:32.754
Don't tell me!

00:18:32.754 --> 00:18:35.814
Has one of those women tracked me down?!

00:18:37.194 --> 00:18:38.684
Yes? Who's there?

00:18:40.794 --> 00:18:43.724
Sakaki, what kind of woman did you hit on?!

00:18:43.934 --> 00:18:45.124
Minamoto!

00:18:47.234 --> 00:18:50.204
Um, excuse me? Are you somebody's boyfriend?

00:18:50.204 --> 00:18:52.224
Or father, possibly?

00:18:57.974 --> 00:19:00.774
I'm sure if we discuss this calmly,
you'll understand!

00:19:00.914 --> 00:19:02.174
Don't play dumb!

00:19:08.554 --> 00:19:10.454
Where is Kaoru Akashi?

00:19:11.124 --> 00:19:13.094
Or, rather, where's the queen?!

00:19:13.894 --> 00:19:14.864
Queen?

00:19:15.394 --> 00:19:18.294
I'll leave the queen with you for today.

00:19:19.664 --> 00:19:22.894
Why did you call Kaoru "queen"?

00:19:27.004 --> 00:19:28.134
That's...

00:19:31.544 --> 00:19:33.344
Nothing good to eat at all.

00:19:33.514 --> 00:19:34.844
In other words...

00:19:35.114 --> 00:19:36.944
You're Hyobu's people!

00:19:39.584 --> 00:19:40.514
Minamoto!

00:19:45.524 --> 00:19:49.094
Bring the queen out, now! I'll never accept it!

00:19:49.094 --> 00:19:50.354
Her, queen?

00:19:50.664 --> 00:19:52.824
Some kid who lives with Normals?!

00:20:03.274 --> 00:20:04.044
Sakaki!

00:20:04.044 --> 00:20:05.944
Okay, where's the queen?

00:20:05.944 --> 00:20:07.574
For your own sake, you'd better tell me!

00:20:09.014 --> 00:20:11.044
What are you?

00:20:13.284 --> 00:20:14.714
Answer me now!

00:20:18.024 --> 00:20:19.494
Minamoto!

00:20:24.764 --> 00:20:29.534
What's with Mom and Sis?
Should've told me some work came up!

00:20:29.534 --> 00:20:31.864
What's the point in going
home to an empty house?

00:20:34.274 --> 00:20:36.794
Still, it's not so bad.

00:20:39.344 --> 00:20:41.774
It's just me!

00:20:41.884 --> 00:20:44.644
Kaoru, you silly girl! You scared me!

00:20:47.184 --> 00:20:48.714
I'll scare him good!

00:20:56.994 --> 00:20:59.024
Wh-What happened?!

00:20:59.764 --> 00:21:01.794
K-Kaoru...

00:21:03.734 --> 00:21:04.964
Dr. Sakaki!

00:21:06.004 --> 00:21:09.134
Get me out. My butt's frozen!

00:21:10.374 --> 00:21:14.114
Whew, good thing you came
back early. You saved me!

00:21:14.114 --> 00:21:17.284
So, what happened? Did someone come here?

00:21:17.284 --> 00:21:18.404
A teleporter.

00:21:19.184 --> 00:21:21.414
A girl, just about your age.

00:21:22.354 --> 00:21:23.514
And Minamoto?

00:21:25.924 --> 00:21:26.894
Minamoto!

00:21:31.094 --> 00:21:32.684
What's this?

00:21:32.764 --> 00:21:33.624
Kaoru!

00:21:34.164 --> 00:21:34.204
I've got the guy with the glasses.
Come if you want him back.

